[Exit Leonato]

[Enter Escalus]
Beatrice: Speak thy mind!
[Exit Escalus]

[Enter Shallow]
Beatrice: Is Benedick better than a summer's day?
    If so, thou art as good as Sebastian. Speak thy mind!
[Exit Shallow]

